            "review_title": "Review at Restaurant Non Nuoc Do",
            "review_text": "Nikko X'mas\nHanoi, Vietnam127 contributions\n0\nBest place in town\nAug 2018 • Family\nIntroduced by a friend, we found our way here with the help of the restaurant owner. It took about 5-7mins to reach the place from Nha Trang station. Just call if you wanna get to the place.\n\nThe place was very beautiful beside the river, wide and clean. The staffs were extremely cute who helped us choosing the right things for our dinner.\n\nMust try food: Cơm rang muối é, mực trứng chiên mắm, cơm lam gà sa lửa, rau rừng luộc kho quẹt. We really did enjoy our dinner. It was perfect....extremely tasty.\n\nFinally, the price was cheap (for me). 700,000vnd/5 people...drinks included.\n\nHighly recommend 💕\nRead more\nWritten September 15, 2018",
